{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "82d8e84b24f455c68d1251cbcd9c591a885d268da9b357c41907ece639a678df", "ja": "階のスターエレメンツ", "zh": "《阶梯上的Star Elements》", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2a66ae7b7af21015253659d2b753bd3b4c0fb09c9e5de65d4588872bbcc219f3", "ja": "撮影初日。練習で何度もつまづいたシーンの\n撮影が始まる。琴葉に対して本気でぶつかる\n未来と可奈。撮影は成功。2人の本気が自分\nをより一層高いところへ引っ張ってくれた、\nと感謝する琴葉。3人での高みを目指す。", "zh": "拍摄第一天，进入练习时数度尝试都不顺利的\n场景，未来和可奈拿出认真态度与琴叶对立。\n拍摄结果很成功，琴叶感谢两人的认真态度，\n连带让自己的演技也提升了一个层次。\n三人就此一同朝更高的目标前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "36b88ba8d35eeb8a7f4e84ef44c7c5fa4fe6ab9431ddd97e1fbfc9f3a8980b10", "ja": "（役づくり期間を終えた未来は、琴葉達と合流……。\n3人での練習を再開した）", "zh": "（已融入角色的未来加入琴叶和可奈……\n三人继续一起练习。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1ffe608e48017353a899b09e2a31e6eaaed728d4733004dc9385931a2f09568c", "ja": "（練習を重ねるごとに3人の演技はみるみる上達し……\nそしてついに、ドラマの撮影本番を迎えた！）", "zh": "（在不断练习之下，三人的演技渐渐提升……\n最后终于迎来电视剧的正式拍摄！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "9fb973d5706bdac3fea4284be22accf5ed0ff904fa3fa06654f87d1155e4261a", "ja": "未来ちゃん、琴葉さん！　次のシーンの撮影、\n予定変更してあそこをやるみたいですよ！", "zh": "未来、琴叶！\n下一幕要拍的戏好像改成那一段了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "62976fe8cd15913b549253f1cd276c2f7d5274df41ba69e91012a669aeb6360d", "ja": "あそこって？", "zh": "那一段是指？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "8bd061d0c952f27f457c51b2d779408b8e47332cfd42b4b0ffd2a3a04e069331", "ja": "あっ……初日にやったシーンだね。\n未来が、私に反発するところ。", "zh": "啊……是我们第一天练习的场景吧。\n就是未来反驳我的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "046c91004d7d1631a1db02707aa02a9bdbbabd11f63f3f64aa63b3ff51d386c0", "ja": "あ！\nそっか。琴葉ちゃんと……。", "zh": "啊！\n这样啊，是和琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "ab8041c47dfb363b1981a9968d1180105d07798be0473c90ea46a45f8147da29", "ja": "未来。私、本気で行くから。\n未来も遠慮なんかしないで、思いっきりお願い。", "zh": "未来，我会认真演的。\n你也不要顾虑太多，尽全力去演吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "403bd1c72e3077d44ebec906764e08533be603b25838c918d293982db08240a9", "ja": "もちろんだよ！\n私だって、思いっきりいっちゃうから！", "zh": "当然！\n我也会尽全力演的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "243ff60d3c312ab625b3e7da4331b3ced4afe87b5c628ede074562bd8370dd7c", "ja": "私も負けない～♪　ちょっとおっかない～♪\nけど、くじけない～♪", "zh": "我也不会输～♪虽然有点怕～♪\n但不会退缩～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5068722386c3040f5ac322b39c2294d75de459461f0e78376d35298457e31345", "ja": "（未来がつまずいた、因縁のシーン。\n3人がどれだけ成長したか、見せてもらうぞ……！）", "zh": "（让未来遭遇瓶颈、终要面对的那一幕。\n让我看看她们三人究竟成长了多少吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "b80770595d3a7a0513a5f2b0c458773e833e23e9b8a02cf7377d091f48f5d5f9", "ja": "『違うとでも？　……実力も、覚悟もないくせに。\nアイドルになりたいなんて、聞いて呆れる』", "zh": "『不是吗？……你们明明没有实力也没有觉悟，\n还说想当偶像，我真是听不下去了。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "4cf41ba6dc5ddc33baf6eaed0d308dc00d4a053bb404a708dcdde32b8db75e9c", "ja": "『ば……馬鹿にしないでっ！　たしかに、\nあなたの方が歌は上手かったかもしれないけど……』", "zh": "『别、别瞧不起我！\n虽然你唱歌的确是唱得比较好……』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "aefd55cabe1ea1c50e76f2c464a4fc4825538392fa697a2f0f0c30d79034f2ff", "ja": "『だからって、遊びでやってるわけじゃない！\n私は絶対に勝ち残って、アイドルになってみせる！』", "zh": "『但我也不是抱着玩玩的心态！\n我一定会赢到最后，当上偶像给你看！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1014_p", "source_sha256": "532f88ac580b104137311e6310bfa3b3011dc075ebe43b475b0a41f14e221a93", "ja": "（絶対アイドルになるんだという、登場人物の感情。\nその強い思いが、痛いくらい伝わってくる……！）", "zh": "（我深刻感受到登场角色那股\n无论如何都想当上偶像的强烈决心……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "0a563913a02c4da3bb4e544785d729707a1882429d173d49af4c94032513cbd6", "ja": "『わ……私も、負けるつもり、ないです。\n私だって、アイドルになるために来たんだから……！』", "zh": "『我……我也不打算认输。\n因为我也是为了当偶像才来的……！』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "be968458389533c9f12c170dc5ebc93aa60b2bbc7d779306f32e22a5d64a492b", "ja": "『そう。なら、勝手にすれば。\n……どうせ時間のムダだと思うけど』", "zh": "『这样啊，那就随你们去吧。\n……反正也只是浪费时间而已。』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1017_kantoku", "source_sha256": "382277fa5c314659a6614cf5ce94f54b039a5ac4f599bd83af12f8eaf142dace", "ja": "カーット！　OKです！", "zh": "卡！OK！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "7786343178070797667187f63d30021b20cdc67e8e20901a8a27827760599455", "ja": "や……やった～！？\nOKだって、琴葉ちゃん、可奈！", "zh": "过……过了～！？\n导演说OK耶，琴叶、可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "3fe95ca0ed598ee0e3c5f97cc0393d96d30ab9ebd16bfd1e1f9a0e4516cb6eb3", "ja": "う、うん！\n緊張したけど、でもがんばってよかった……！", "zh": "对、对呀！\n虽然刚刚很紧张，但有努力去演真是太好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "3510d5a26d848238a5dbf93fac800901fff4a362d27302948e80055eda80c4bd", "ja": "ふぅ……ありがとう未来、可奈ちゃん。\nふたりのおかげで、満足のいく演技ができた気がする。", "zh": "呼……未来、可奈，谢谢你们。\n多亏你们，我觉得自己也拿出了满意的演技。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "f483d42702c17baa76f53eb8d7c32a84bc7cdee29e095e645c7b324438a0183a", "ja": "もう、ゼッタイ逆だよ、琴葉ちゃん！\n私たちが上手にできたのが、琴葉ちゃんのおかげ！", "zh": "真是的，根本是反过来吧，琴叶！\n我们之所以能演好，都是多亏琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "808582c7744b106a710e9f75481084768641ab63c115e3b8b594cb64ede1bc62", "ja": "ううん。お芝居って、相手がいて初めて成り立つ\nものだから……相手の演技が、刺激になるの。", "zh": "不，是因为有演对手戏的对象，才会形成戏剧……\n对方的演技会成为一种刺激。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "bbb4ab18d23a1ed69ddf3bd3e1ba66fa89783200889a5785ca28aace7123721f", "ja": "今日はふたりが本気でぶつかって来てくれたから、\n私も、これまでより一段高いところに行けた。", "zh": "今天因为你们两个全心全力投入情感，\n我的表现才能更上一层楼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "04ca8d3f3066a4469782e9e2dff31d6b382aba3dbdf7dad660ff9d2e7917d98b", "ja": "ふたりの演技が、私を引っ張ってくれたの。\nだから、本当にありがとう！", "zh": "你们的演技带动了我，\n所以真的很谢谢你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "310f9a297d406895d74d862a004d669c1e0da76d37d6cd3fd9a5e7416ddec8ad", "ja": "琴葉さん……。", "zh": "琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "b3ea6b1728645326cc901658c1b4a83bbbb07b987c44a5f323ade4f5c4c71c17", "ja": "え、えへへ……。そんなに？\nなんか照れちゃうな～。", "zh": "嘿、嘿嘿……有这么夸张吗？\n有点害羞耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1027_014mir", "source_sha256": "0736e5f6b192a78de3c199f77367e329a62d57bb30cd149b17bba53ef66ada5a", "ja": "琴葉ちゃん、可奈！　私たち3人で、\nもっともーっと高いところ、目指せるかな？", "zh": "琴叶、可奈！我们三人一起努力，\n是不是就能朝更高更高的目标前进呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "16624a1a2311f54be3653463693eeaf8ad50a7f5d9036b537b456172ec76cbab", "ja": "ふふっ。そうだね！\nこのドラマの最後まで……お互い、全力で！", "zh": "呵呵，没有错！\n我们都要全力以赴……拍完这部戏！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "a113e57dba8b0371d7cd3a0226fd090e0bf0ef5d9891dec1b2b5186235ead4be", "ja": "はいっ！　がんばるばる～♪　ライバルバル～♪", "zh": "好的！加油加油油～♪劲敌劲敌敌～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1030_p", "source_sha256": "351ed0ef436b1ea4fbf4b3c8e80b5173db15cea3ca9303089ffa5038ca7302cf", "ja": "（こうして、撮影初日が無事終わった。\n3人の熱演に、周囲が飲み込まれていく……）", "zh": "（就这样，拍摄第一天顺利结束。\n三人的精采演技让周遭的人深深着迷……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1031_p", "source_sha256": "5108dfc18abf6c0cb5ac1accb1f714335686046dd8bfbd54cf7d74e9206c3eb3", "ja": "（そう、3人がずっと、そうしてきたように。\nこれからも彼女達は階を駆け上がっていくだろう）", "zh": "（没错，就像这三人一路以来努力不懈，\n今后她们一定也会继续奔驰、登上阶梯吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0083_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0083_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "eab9aa6aca5499d80f012ba74c396fac2bea895ed4ecc61f52019dcc2ee192cb", "ja": "（仲間という、最高の……ライバル達と一緒に！）", "zh": "（彼此以伙伴的身分相伴……同时也是最棒的劲敌！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
